  <section class="hero shell v2-hero"><p class="chapter-number">00 / Position</p><h1>Matthew Ralph</h1><p class="hero-progression"><span>Commercial operator</span><i>→</i><span>Governed systems</span><i>→</i><span>AI transformation</span></p><p class="lead">Business systems and AI transformation operator focused on governed workflows, technical-program direction, and operational systems.</p><p class="role-focus">Focused on roles where commercial judgment, workflow design, governance, and operational execution have to work together.</p><p class="hero-actions"><a class="text-link" href="#selected-work">Explore systems <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="text-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/salessuccess/">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/matt-rfs/matthew-ralph-work-samples">Public work samples <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p></section>

